WEBVTT

00:01.230 --> 00:02.960
Sara...

00:02.960 --> 00:07.200
So, you do still bear a grudge against me, then?

00:07.200 --> 00:10.710
No, actually I'm grateful to you.

00:10.710 --> 00:15.040
You guided me to become a shard caster.

00:15.040 --> 00:20.500
Zico, I'll give you a chance to learn
that I'm different now!

00:21.980 --> 00:23.610
Old man!

00:34.360 --> 00:35.560
Mom...

00:48.640 --> 00:56.250
Far away from the town where I was born

00:56.250 --> 00:59.420
I am singing

00:59.420 --> 01:07.060
Tucking my weak heart and my wavering feelings

01:07.060 --> 01:10.330
Away in my pocket

01:10.330 --> 01:15.870
Toward where I hear someone calling me

01:15.870 --> 01:20.910
Toward the unknown road

01:20.910 --> 01:26.350
I'll walk

01:26.350 --> 01:31.750
I'll move forward

01:31.750 --> 01:36.590
Not for someone else's sake

01:36.590 --> 01:42.060
But just as I am, so that I can take pride

01:42.060 --> 01:47.540
Just as the sun rises at dawn

01:47.540 --> 01:52.770
I pick out a melody with my voice

01:52.770 --> 01:56.800
Ephemerally yet strongly

01:58.450 --> 02:01.970
I live

02:07.160 --> 02:11.020
Episode 43
Truth Made Known

02:15.500 --> 02:17.120
Mom...

02:18.700 --> 02:21.600
What? Zed's mother?

02:21.600 --> 02:24.910
She is?

02:24.910 --> 02:29.370
Why is my mom here?

02:32.310 --> 02:34.780
Zed, you must not go to her!

02:40.890 --> 02:42.520
Master Zico!

02:44.430 --> 02:46.050
Mom!

02:51.070 --> 02:52.690
Mom!

03:13.790 --> 03:16.760
What the hell is going on?

03:16.760 --> 03:18.390
Mom...

03:29.070 --> 03:34.870
So, that's my limit wielding a key spirit
with the power I have now?

03:38.910 --> 03:40.980
What's going on, old man?!

03:40.980 --> 03:43.780
Do you know my mom?

03:48.360 --> 03:49.990
Answer me!

03:49.990 --> 03:53.120
What the hell happened between you and Mom?!

03:57.800 --> 04:02.260
I always thought I'd have to tell you someday.

04:03.240 --> 04:07.140
Sorry, but would you leave Zed and me alone?

04:07.140 --> 04:08.770
Sure...

04:17.850 --> 04:20.150
Come with me.

04:30.230 --> 04:32.270
This bread is really good.

04:32.270 --> 04:34.140
My friend baked it.

04:34.140 --> 04:35.640
Hey, what's wrong?

04:35.640 --> 04:37.510
You haven't eaten a bite.

04:37.510 --> 04:40.380
Aren't you feeling well?

04:40.380 --> 04:44.210
That woman followed me here.

04:44.210 --> 04:45.850
That woman?

04:45.850 --> 04:48.820
You don't mean Zed's mother?

04:50.750 --> 04:52.290
But...

04:52.290 --> 04:58.660
I don't really know why,
but she was in the Seekers.

04:58.660 --> 05:02.290
She must have come to take me back there.

05:03.300 --> 05:07.430
So, she's Zed's mother, she's in the Seekers...

05:09.970 --> 05:11.940
What does this mean?

05:18.080 --> 05:19.480
What is this place?

05:19.480 --> 05:25.040
The place where Amir Gaul's spirit shard
was enshrined long ago.

05:25.650 --> 05:27.280
Amir Gaul?

05:27.760 --> 05:33.220
Amir Gaul was originally regarded as something
like a guardian deity to Templar.

05:34.200 --> 05:37.000
One reason he was enshrined here for so long

05:37.000 --> 05:41.300
is that there was no one who
could wield his power.

05:41.940 --> 05:45.240
Including me.

05:45.540 --> 05:50.980
But in this era of war, I sought power.

05:50.980 --> 05:54.620
If I couldn't use it, I'd find someone who could.

05:54.620 --> 06:00.920
I didn't worship Amir Gaul;
I desired him as a form of power.

06:04.730 --> 06:06.430
Are you ready?

06:06.430 --> 06:07.430
Yes!

06:07.430 --> 06:11.230
I will make Amir Gaul's power my own,
without fail.

07:12.130 --> 07:15.100
So, he couldn't do it either.

07:18.030 --> 07:26.840
Back then, I didn't yet know that Amir Gaul
chooses his own master.

07:28.240 --> 07:31.370
It happened suddenly one day...

07:31.750 --> 07:35.550
We received a revelation of Amir Gaul's will.

07:38.190 --> 07:40.150
Wh..What is this?

07:52.170 --> 07:56.970
Does this mean Amir Gaul himself
has chosen that woman?

07:57.470 --> 08:00.810
Amir Gaul chose my mom?

08:00.810 --> 08:04.950
I set off for your home world of Calm.

08:04.950 --> 08:06.810
What? Calm?!

08:06.810 --> 08:08.380
Yes...

08:08.380 --> 08:13.510
I never told you, but I've been to Calm.

08:32.510 --> 08:36.970
I have come for you, by order of Amir Gaul.

08:52.330 --> 08:55.120
You brought Mom here?!

09:00.500 --> 09:03.870
She's probably hiding in this forest!

09:03.870 --> 09:05.070
Be on your guard!

09:05.070 --> 09:06.700
Yes, sir!

09:13.310 --> 09:15.280
Where is she?

09:41.540 --> 09:42.910
Not yet...

09:42.910 --> 09:47.370
One man is not enough
for me to recover my strength.

09:51.550 --> 09:58.090
This technique is something I mastered
in order to freely wield Amir Gaul someday.

09:58.090 --> 10:03.050
In order to make Amir Gaul mine again...

10:11.570 --> 10:13.740
Where am I?

10:13.740 --> 10:15.780
Who are you?

10:15.780 --> 10:19.280
You have been chosen by Amir Gaul.

10:19.280 --> 10:24.420
Your great power shall save this world.

10:24.420 --> 10:26.390
Rejoice.

11:09.900 --> 11:11.520
Wait!

11:30.750 --> 11:36.880
I'll never forget that rapture, that ecstasy...

11:39.260 --> 11:43.060
I must have that power again!

11:48.840 --> 11:50.400
And?

11:50.400 --> 11:53.340
What happened to Mom after that?

11:53.340 --> 11:56.380
After Sara attained Amir Gaul,
I trained her very hard,

11:56.380 --> 12:02.340
so that she would be able to freely use his power.

12:02.880 --> 12:07.680
But then something happened that
I'd never even imagined.

12:35.380 --> 12:37.020
Zico, it's Zymot!

12:37.020 --> 12:39.320
Zymot is invading!

12:52.400 --> 12:55.700
What weak shard casters!

12:55.700 --> 12:58.170
Templar is nothing to be afraid of!

13:00.570 --> 13:02.540
Wh..What's that?!

13:07.280 --> 13:09.320
We won't let you have your way here!

13:09.320 --> 13:10.680
Zico!

13:10.680 --> 13:12.480
Get him!

13:42.320 --> 13:44.110
Guardian!

14:16.720 --> 14:18.510
Amir Gaul!

14:23.390 --> 14:25.020
Why?

14:28.200 --> 14:29.820
Sara!

14:48.850 --> 14:51.320
Wh..What's that?!

14:51.320 --> 14:53.120
Oh no!

15:10.770 --> 15:14.070
That's Amir Gaul...

15:15.640 --> 15:19.770
That's Amir Gaul, without a doubt!

15:22.380 --> 15:25.680
You're Amir Gaul?

15:30.720 --> 15:32.350
Wait!

15:32.660 --> 15:34.460
Where are you going?

15:34.900 --> 15:38.900
Oh, Amir Gaul, aren't you mine?

15:38.900 --> 15:42.030
Oh, why are you leaving me?!

15:45.540 --> 15:47.170
Why?

15:51.410 --> 15:53.310
What was that about?

15:53.310 --> 15:55.780
Just what happened here?

16:00.650 --> 16:06.460
We couldn't understand what had happened.

16:07.590 --> 16:09.890
Not at the time, at any rate.

16:10.430 --> 16:13.400
But I understand now.

16:17.870 --> 16:18.870
Master Zico!

16:18.870 --> 16:22.110
Master Zico, that woman who
just invaded the castle

16:22.110 --> 16:24.650
is taking down our sentries one by one!

16:24.650 --> 16:25.150
What?!

16:25.150 --> 16:26.480
My mom is?!
What?!

16:26.480 --> 16:28.110
Wait!

16:30.550 --> 16:33.790
Have you become a demon then, Sara?

16:33.790 --> 16:40.090
But I'm the very man who created that demon.

16:50.070 --> 16:51.470
Not yet...

16:51.470 --> 16:53.440
It's still not enough!

16:55.310 --> 16:57.280
What's Mom trying to do?

17:06.620 --> 17:11.750
That system of Ulvarx's wasn't
such a big deal after all.

17:12.330 --> 17:13.660
No...

17:13.660 --> 17:16.100
If that fusion system can't control Amir Gaul,

17:16.100 --> 17:20.630
possessing it would be pointless.

17:20.630 --> 17:26.070
But that Zed boy certainly made a fool out of you.

17:26.070 --> 17:28.080
This humiliation...

17:28.080 --> 17:30.440
I'll pay him back for it, make no mistake,

17:30.440 --> 17:35.180
and I will personally recover Amir Gaul!

17:35.180 --> 17:39.590
Naturally, but Amir Gaul alone is not enough.

17:39.590 --> 17:43.660
We must gather all the key spirits.

17:43.660 --> 17:48.290
And Lady Mirred is the only one
worthy of them, of course.

18:05.880 --> 18:09.450
How are you, Lady Mirred?

18:09.450 --> 18:12.850
I'd like to see for myself how vast the sky is.

18:12.850 --> 18:17.190
I don't know the true vastness of the sky.

18:17.190 --> 18:21.030
The sky is vast, isn't it, Xeem?

18:21.030 --> 18:27.430
When you become the savior and the conflicts
between nations are quelled,

18:27.430 --> 18:30.230
you'll be able to freely see the sky.

18:32.710 --> 18:36.440
Right now, there are those who would kill you.

18:36.440 --> 18:38.240
Please forgive us.

18:39.010 --> 18:42.380
I understand the consideration you show me.

18:42.380 --> 18:44.350
I am grateful.

18:49.420 --> 18:50.960
It's Gitra, isn't it?

18:50.960 --> 18:52.890
Yes...

18:52.890 --> 18:56.520
Right now, this pipe organ is what
I look forward to each day.

18:57.560 --> 19:02.870
It is my pleasure, my solace.

19:13.610 --> 19:20.420
I pray my performance will be of some
small comfort to you, Lady Mirred.

19:29.630 --> 19:31.930
Stop this, Sara.

19:34.770 --> 19:37.940
Do you have the right to tell me that?

19:37.940 --> 19:43.240
You're the one who made me like this, Zico!

19:48.450 --> 19:50.620
What do you mean, "go home"?

19:50.620 --> 19:53.290
I've been chosen by Amir Gaul!

19:53.290 --> 19:56.590
I don't know what happened either,

19:56.590 --> 20:01.300
but you weren't chosen by Amir Gaul after all.

20:01.300 --> 20:02.630
No!

20:02.630 --> 20:06.230
Please... Please, give me Amir Gaul's
power one more time.

20:06.230 --> 20:08.030
Out of the question!

20:09.170 --> 20:11.800
Go home to Calm.

20:15.280 --> 20:20.910
You would never understand how I
suffered after returning to Calm.

20:21.680 --> 20:24.520
The agony of losing that rapture...

20:24.520 --> 20:28.960
It tore apart my heart, my mind, my soul!

20:28.960 --> 20:34.260
But I picked myself up from out of that agony.

20:35.030 --> 20:36.400
It's no use.

20:36.400 --> 20:41.240
No matter how you struggle,
you won't be able to get Amir Gaul.

20:41.240 --> 20:42.740
What?

20:42.740 --> 20:45.340
I think you know as well as I do.

20:45.340 --> 20:49.140
I couldn't understand back then either,

20:49.140 --> 20:53.100
but you were not the one Amir Gaul chose!

20:53.580 --> 20:59.040
Sara, it was Zed, the baby in your womb.

21:05.960 --> 21:13.760
The time has come, and Amir Gaul now
dwells within his true chosen.

21:15.070 --> 21:17.200
So what?

21:17.840 --> 21:21.380
If Zed were to die, that power would...

21:21.380 --> 21:23.170
What?!

21:29.550 --> 21:30.550
There he is!

21:30.550 --> 21:31.820
Master Zico!

21:31.820 --> 21:33.220
Master Zico!

21:33.220 --> 21:36.350
Sagiri says Zed's mom followed her here!

21:39.560 --> 21:40.830
That's right.

21:40.830 --> 21:44.130
The reason I'm gathering key spirits

21:44.130 --> 21:47.260
is to prepare for wielding Amir Gaul.

21:48.640 --> 21:52.590
I need your key spirit too.

21:53.410 --> 21:55.710
Now, give it to me!

21:55.910 --> 21:57.110
Stop, Sara!

21:57.110 --> 21:58.980
Mom!

21:58.980 --> 22:00.110
What are you doing?!

22:00.110 --> 22:01.910
Stop it!

22:07.690 --> 22:09.390
Zed...

22:09.390 --> 22:11.520
My Zed...

22:11.990 --> 22:14.120
Dear, dear Zed...

22:15.060 --> 22:18.860
I love you...

22:20.000 --> 22:21.970
...and I despise you!

22:24.340 --> 22:26.140
Mom...

22:39.620 --> 22:42.020
I just wanted to get away

22:42.020 --> 22:44.920
From that troublesome place

22:45.860 --> 22:49.230
And flap my wings

22:49.230 --> 22:54.430
How many times have I scolded myself

22:54.430 --> 23:00.070
For still being so immature?

23:01.140 --> 23:05.980
I'll just move with all I've got

23:05.980 --> 23:11.620
Towards that promised place

23:11.620 --> 23:17.220
Ours are true wings

23:17.220 --> 23:24.000
Of very, very beautiful feathers

23:24.000 --> 23:26.700
So we won't succumb

23:26.700 --> 23:33.740
To even the greatest, most intense gust of wind

23:33.740 --> 23:43.820
We must fly far, far away with all we've got

23:43.820 --> 23:49.560
See, now we're one with the wind

23:49.560 --> 23:54.630
And we can look back and laugh at those days

23:54.630 --> 23:57.930
We choked back so many tears

23:59.930 --> 24:03.890
All the way to the ends of the world

24:17.750 --> 24:20.950
Next Time
An Unbreakable Spell

24:18.120 --> 24:20.950


Next time, "An Unbreakable Spell"
